    "$t": "逐家來phò-tāu - 今仔日哪ē án-ne？"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《今仔日哪ē án-ne？》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/陳文賓</span></h2><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiFaTfoZn9vc6Whpo9dxSFNsJ9HUA7sNBBBOzwfJg8ZKuxH3SL-8s71IMVwlKonkTqAjaa2D0Vc7goD_TdNqJ30l9VaWialRbC72ZSF2PY-YSY2QdL_O04xtVFE0SLXvVRESa74fpfeZ9yOUF1ZFfJ3Jo91JfDpKPunN47k1reb3g211tvpBLRKta3P5I_C\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiFaTfoZn9vc6Whpo9dxSFNsJ9HUA7sNBBBOzwfJg8ZKuxH3SL-8s71IMVwlKonkTqAjaa2D0Vc7goD_TdNqJ30l9VaWialRbC72ZSF2PY-YSY2QdL_O04xtVFE0SLXvVRESa74fpfeZ9yOUF1ZFfJ3Jo91JfDpKPunN47k1reb3g211tvpBLRKta3P5I_C=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFafnUf2c4jctX2YQuBppTGBpW0Kf1GPmH3PWhXondqH0X_15o0bAlsQNbo7iryJy5Z-gPM0Agal7mvOXjNNl2ZpLT7ABhHY0o07yUDS7osXgXpcxM2RJ2alvw1VMcKy0trpczh1O0wXmXmvZnwmzud3cw8T9Kic17AA1uelPyQ1Cy8DiBUY8-JLCrTQbj\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFafnUf2c4jctX2YQuBppTGBpW0Kf1GPmH3PWhXondqH0X_15o0bAlsQNbo7iryJy5Z-gPM0Agal7mvOXjNNl2ZpLT7ABhHY0o07yUDS7osXgXpcxM2RJ2alvw1VMcKy0trpczh1O0wXmXmvZnwmzud3cw8T9Kic17AA1uelPyQ1Cy8DiBUY8-JLCrTQbj\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgKQHuBFq2HbXp326ZKWuOBjKV6W8WnypAjC4lqjUD3KKnMZv_8lE1yab-VrKcSHZB7UWyrhJ1fumSfTbyaVv7DLTJMaC9-r_nUP5ZXj6G7IVKiJfUJDfXSSGoReWqLOzAhud5DaZ3Yxv3xTRo3hr7oNoujSoIxDxThQieGP-Vvk-GjpiRwUsgyW8J7fa5v\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgKQHuBFq2HbXp326ZKWuOBjKV6W8WnypAjC4lqjUD3KKnMZv_8lE1yab-VrKcSHZB7UWyrhJ1fumSfTbyaVv7DLTJMaC9-r_nUP5ZXj6G7IVKiJfUJDfXSSGoReWqLOzAhud5DaZ3Yxv3xTRo3hr7oNoujSoIxDxThQieGP-Vvk-GjpiRwUsgyW8J7fa5v\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEie7pcynrfqslcdbQU8E2y73ae9TfgckVYlmV-DyKJXkbzDfDd70HS-trQRpuDydgQccNim5Lt5wZzRKEyBonHE3oUJxNuZGe4M9qdRdufj7xBszTp9N6XYMLcZx7gKa-xOQtjGH31CIW7Gn_FJTs9pFKsn9Q7YdOsHkwmpO8Y8hR_9yzKP-slIylkdRPTF\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEie7pcynrfqslcdbQU8E2y73ae9TfgckVYlmV-DyKJXkbzDfDd70HS-trQRpuDydgQccNim5Lt5wZzRKEyBonHE3oUJxNuZGe4M9qdRdufj7xBszTp9N6XYMLcZx7gKa-xOQtjGH31CIW7Gn_FJTs9pFKsn9Q7YdOsHkwmpO8Y8hR_9yzKP-slIylkdRPTF=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">今仔日透早，我ê心情tsiânn好，感覺講一定是一个順序ê日子！</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">阿母特別tshuân ê sio̍k-pháng kah li̋n-jín lìn-gòo汁tsiah食煞，我就kā冊揹仔揹--起-來，beh坐bá-suh準備來去學校。拄坐--落-來，我雄雄發現手--裡提--ê m̄是手機仔，suah是厝內ê la-jí-ooh！阿娘uê，tse是用來錄kha-lá-óo-khe練歌--ê，哪ē紮來去學校--ah？M̄-koh kā想看māi，想講趕緊落車tńg去厝--裡提手機仔khah要緊。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">趕tńg到厝了後，序大人ê oo-tóo-bái歹--去--ah，ia̋n-jín聲khngh-khngh叫，tòo-sàng leh提loo-lài-bà tī hia修理。我無時間kā看，手機仔提--leh隨衝出門，siáng知走siunn緊，鞋帶līng--去，去hōo路邊ê á-geh擔仔kuāinn一下跋倒，規个人phak tī擔仔位頭前ê oo-lián kah thia̋n-pú-lah頂kuân！Oo-jí-sáng頭家趕緊kā我插--起-來，koh hōo我一杯lê-bóng汁，hōo我硩驚心頭定。</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsiânn無簡單tsiah行到學校，suah發現美術課ài紮ê na̋i-lóng索仔kah糊仔bē記得紮，囥tī厝--裡。同學看我雙手空空，kí對教室ê kha-tián講：「若無，直接用kha-tián來做！」規班笑hai-hai，我kánn-ná é-káu--ê，kan-na ē-tàng gōng-gōng仔笑，滿面是tsuan豆花！</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">放學tńg來到厝，我kā阿母講今仔日ê趣味代，順suà講早起挵著擔仔位ê代誌。阿母聽煞，顛倒笑笑仔講：「Tsiânn拄好！明仔載替我去hia買一份sú-sih kah thak-khooh-iá-khih tńg--來。」 Tsit工真正是tsiok精彩--ê！</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">編註：Tsit篇文章刁工用真濟外來詞，m̄-nā呈現出台語詞彙ê豐富，koh thang hōo lán了解著用羅馬字標寫外來詞ê重要性。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgAtAPNkRDKMHy5cnMBusTIBcZ9r44SUoL_bsKgI26W103kc7A3WBoQKD_LrI1aHhUiCBklOiA_wOm3AL0EXJ7Xn3VQSXiI14uv89156S8Jip9wr1vx5sm5d1oXvkJ7VxHBREszjgrOsbfNs_IFXP07eFcx5sqS2KstpFaLgWKjnOOqfwPFNH5SIUG-ppjQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"sepa